     highlights:["<b>Supported discs:</b> PAL original (v1.03) and Platinum (v2.01), USA original (v1.00) and Greatest Hits (v1.01). PAL discs keep all their languages.","<b>Slide steering:</b> Crash can steer a little while sliding (tunable; 0 is the PS2).","Vehicle controls appear on screen the first time you ride each vehicle.","The relic now turns and glows when you set a new time trial record, which no PS2 version did.","PCSX2 memory card import finds USA saves too."],
