     highlights:["<b>Auto-updater:</b> when a new version is out, choose UPDATE on the title menu and NuWorld downloads, installs and restarts (Windows and Linux).","Aku Aku has a new cutscene after you beat Rok-Ko for the first time."],
     heads:["0.9.0 and older don't have the updater yet, so download this version by hand one last time.","Windows Defender flagged 0.9.0 as a trojan. It was a false alarm (a machine-learning guess), and the build has been changed to avoid it."],
