     perf:["Windows: a Graphics card option, which now picks the faster card by default. That should help laptops."],
     heads:["<b>New defaults for Crash</b> (the developer strongly recommends trying them): Crash 4 jump arc and Longer Spin on, Faster Run off, plus tweaks to grip, slides, edge reach and monkey bars.","New visual defaults: Fog at 40%, distance blur and heat haze off, and jump camera stability at 50%."],
