     highlights:["<b>CUSTOMIZE for added fighters:</b> every human-sized one can wear the shop's upper and lower body outfits, with colours, PAINT and five saved slots each. No hair or head items yet.","PAINT works without a Wii U GamePad: mouse, touch screen, or controller.","Added fighters keep their own rank and win/loss record.","Azazel can crouch and guard normally, and roars instead of using Lars's voice.","A second round of beta-tester fixes for Clive Rosfield and Miary Zo."],
