     highlights:["<b>New: Azazel</b> (Tekken 8), about 4 metres tall, with his crystal pillars, beam and tail attacks. The fight camera pulls back to keep him in frame.","Tekken 8 fighters now take hits with Tekken 8's own reactions, and counter-hit checks work.","Dozens of move fixes for Clive Rosfield, Miary Zo and Victor Chevalier, so launches, counter hits and follow-ups behave as in Tekken 8.","Every Tekken 7 parry and counter is back, including Leroy's b+2 and Geese's counters."],
